Regarding their H&C application, the Applicants have submitted multiple pieces of evidence in respect of their social and economic establishment in the community:
A letter from the École Laurendeau-Dunton (P-18) and a letter from Eagle Plains Public School (P-19) as proof of their son’s current and previous enrolment in school;
Letters of support from members of various community organizations, explaining the Principal Applicant’s involvement in the Christ Embassy Church to which the Applicants are committed as congregants and benefactors (P-10, P-11 and P-17);
In addition, letters of support were submitted from members of multiple community organization in which the Applicants have been actively volunteering (P-13, P-14, P-15 and P-16);
Written testimony from the Principal Applicant as to the fact that he has been financially independent and working to support his family (P-6);
Residential lease and proof of payments of the lease obligations (P-8 and P-9).
